 t:\n\nSource: Odisha Food Supplies Dept\, farmer registration rules for th
 is season https://www.foododisha.in/Download/Farmer-Registration-Modalitie
 s-2026-27.pdf\n\nMore: https://farmbot.curiosta.com/calendar/#ev-paddy-buy
 ing
